ONNX model source: https://huggingface.co/Qdrant/bge-small-zh-v1.5

Official DeepSeek V4 tokenizer data, downloaded locally for planning only:
https://cdn.deepseek.com/api-docs/deepseek_v4_tokenizer.zip
Only allowlisted JSON data is extracted; archive Python code is not executed.
Tokenizer/runtime files are not distributed in this repository.

pgvector: https://github.com/pgvector/pgvector (PostgreSQL License).
Pinned Windows PG18 binaries: https://github.com/andreiramani/pgvector_pgsql_windows/releases/tag/0.8.7

Third-party models, binaries, runtime data and credentials are not included in this repository.

QQ integration downloads NapCatQQ v4.18.42 locally (not redistributed here).
https://github.com/NapNeko/NapCatQQ/releases/tag/v4.18.42
NapCat's upstream Limited Redistribution License (non-commercial):
